  "Question": "Lines \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are cut by line \\(c\\). Which of the following conditions establishes that \\(a\\parallel b\\)?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Same-side interior angles are equal.",
    "B": "Corresponding angles are supplementary.",
